<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109979" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψῐ-πέτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου,</span>
		
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψῐ-πέτας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτομαι</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>high-flying, soaring,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰετός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.201
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				219
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.243
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψιπετᾶν ἀνέμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.105
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενοίμαν αἰετὸς ὑψιπέτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					476
				</span></i>
			
			=
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1337
			</span></i> (lyr.): 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.45
			</span></i>:—some unnamed Gramm. (in opposition to
			Aristarchus) wrote <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψιπετῆς</span> (
				contr.
			 from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψιπετήεις</span>),
				v. Sch. A <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				12.201
			</span></i>; the acc. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑψιπετῆ
			ὄρνιθα</span> in Ant. <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				16.2
			</span></i> belongs in sense to this word, in form to the next.</div>
